WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.572
Row-level validation is useful, but managers and analysts often need a summary.

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:10.872
This query combines several issue detectors with UNION ALL.

00:00:10.872 --> 00:00:16.482
Then it groups by entity and issue type to count how many problems exist.

00:00:16.482 --> 00:00:21.132
This turns cleaning logic into a measurable quality report.

00:00:21.132 --> 00:00:26.112
Validation is rule-based detection, not automatic correction.

00:00:26.112 --> 00:00:33.272
A failed email-shape check tells you that a record deserves attention; it does not tell you the correct email.

00:00:33.272 --> 00:00:40.594
Treat quality flags as evidence that can drive quarantine, review, or a documented repair process.
